+# A bracket is a control only when every word is listed and at least one is a cue.
+# Words are split on spaces, commas and hyphens after normalization.
+# Sources: tags in Fish Audio's Drama 3 and Emotion Control docs (docs.fish.audio), the Drama 3 model card and the Drama 3 technical report (arXiv:2610.18010).
+## cues
+happy
+sad
+angry
+excited
